Package: changepoints
Type: Package
Title: Time Series Approximation Via Smallest Valid Partitioning
Version: 1.0
Encoding: UTF-8
Date: 2025-05-15
Authors@R: c(
    person("Alexandre", "Combeau", email = "alexandre.combeau.77@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Vincent", "Runge", email = "vincent.runge@univ-evry.fr", role = c("aut"))
            )
Maintainer: Alexandre Combeau <alexandre.combeau.77@gmail.com>
Description: Provides a flexible framework for segmenting univariate time series using custom validation rules such as variance threshold, range, quantile range, or external changepoint detection like FOCuS. The main algorithm implements a dynamic programming approach with optional pruning to find the smallest number of valid segments, while minimizing a quadratic cost.
